      "id": "montpellier-day1-evening-2026",
      "category": "International",
      "headline": "WTT Champions Montpellier: Félix Lebrun and Chen Yi win openers as Matsushima survives Qiu",
      "summary": "Félix Lebrun beat Denmark's Anders Lind 11-8, 11-3, 11-3 and Chen Yi recovered from losing the first game to beat Peng Yu-han 3-1 on the first evening of WTT Champions Montpellier. Top seed Sora Matsushima beat Dang Qiu 11-2 in the deciding game, Elizabeta Samara knocked out Germany's Han Ying, and Truls Moregard beat Thibault Poret 3-0 despite appearing to feel his shoulder.",
      "body": [
        "Lebrun won 14 of 17 points after taking a close first game against Lind, tennis2table reported. He plays Oh Junsung or Zhou Qihao in the round of 16. Chen Yi lost the first game 12-10 from 9-8 up, then dropped only 12 points in the next three, according to Sina Sports. She meets Wang Manyu or Hana Goda next.",
        "Matsushima led Qiu by two games, lost the next two 11-3 and 12-10, then took the decider 11-2, tischtennis.de reported. Samara beat Han 11-8, 11-4, 8-11, 11-7. Moregard won 11-8, 11-6, 11-8 but reached for his shoulder during the third game, Swedish media reported; it is not clear how serious it is.",
        "Earlier, Lin Yun-Ju came from 2-1 down to beat Portugal's João Geraldo 8-11, 11-4, 5-11, 11-4, 11-6, according to United Daily News."
      ],
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "published": "2026-10-27T21:58:00Z",
